(text "POWER: bridge 1-2 for 5 V OR 2-3 for regulated 12 V. NEVER bridge all three.\nBIAS: bridge 1-2 for NPN, 2-3 for PNP, leave open for push-pull/external bias.\nAll selectors are open as fabricated. Voltage-tolerant NPN output required for selected pullup." (at 15 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7cc3002e-2d3c-5c4f-8e0b-dc5d073db614"))
